</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">

    <div class="about-highlight">
      <p class="eyebrow">My Approach</p>

      <h3>
        Learn continuously. Work carefully. Improve consistently.
      </h3>

      <p>
        I believe good work comes from attention to detail,
        clear communication, and a willingness to learn.
        I bring those values to every project and task.
      </p>
